5. REMEDIES AND FINANCIAL RESPONSIBILITY FOR VIOLATIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

You acknowledge and agree that:

  (a) DAMAGES. If You redistribute, modify, reverse engineer, or otherwise use
      the Software in violation of Section 2, You shall be financially liable
      to Licensor for all resulting damages, including direct, indirect,
      consequential, and incidental damages; all lost license fees, lost
